{
  "version": 1,
  "purpose": "P0 behavior baseline for #1210: every behavior the unified debug engine must keep. Each item points at the executable evidence on the current Swift session, Rust Core and Windows host. status covered = every platform that owns the behavior has a test; partial = some platforms lack a test; gap = no test yet and P1 must add one before the old path is removed. Windows is out of scope for the P0/P1 phase tracked here (macOS and the shared Rust Core only); Windows evidence is kept where it exists but its absence is not a gap.",
  "sourceNote": ".agents/notes/proposed/architecture/2026-10-25-unified-debug-engine-and-adapter-registry.md",
